Intentionally empty.

LVGL's env_support/cmake/esp.cmake lists this directory in INCLUDE_DIRS
unconditionally, so idf_component_register() fails if it is missing -- but the
sources inside are only compiled when CONFIG_LV_BUILD_EXAMPLES or one of the
CONFIG_LV_USE_DEMO_* options is enabled, and this firmware enables none of
them. The contents were dropped to keep the vendored tree small (they are
~68 MB); the directory itself has to stay.
